WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:127826

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.571
Congratulations. You've now built across the entire Generative UI spectrum.

2
00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:07.173
You started with controlled Generative UI.

3
00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:11.778
where you, as the programmer, had full control over every single component.

4
00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:14.481
You then moved to declarative Generative UI.

5
00:00:15.148 --> 00:00:18.752
We defined building blocks that the agents could assemble on demand.

6
00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.755
You then connected your agent to third-party MCP apps,

7
00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:25.658
and you even explored fully open-ended Generative UI.

8
00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.495
where the agent creates interfaces from scratch.

9
00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:30.897
Finally, you built a shared state application

10
00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:33.600
where the agent and the frontend stay in sync

11
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.203
beyond the chat window. The key takeaway is this,

12
00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:39.839
There's no one approach to rule them all.

13
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.442
Each part of the Generative UI spectrum

14
00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:45.245
serves a different need. And now you have the tools

15
00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:47.447
to mix and match those in your own applications.

16
00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:51.618
And because everything you built uses the open-source AG-UI protocol,

17
00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:56.951
These patterns work across the entire agentic ecosystem, not just within CopilotKit.

18
00:00:57.357 --> 00:01:01.461
This course explored the first layer of the agentic frontend stack.

19
00:01:01.761 --> 00:01:04.697
But there's a lot more. From the persistence layer

20
00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.600
of all of this rich interactivity to the insight layer,

21
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.536
that allows you to understand how your

22
00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:11.604
users are interacting with your agents in production.

23
00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:15.208
All the way to the self-improvement layer that allows your agents

24
00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:18.912
to learn across interactions and improve on their own over time.

25
00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:21.514
We hope you'll join us to keep learning.

26
00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:24.217
You can start by exploring the CopilotKit docs

27
00:01:24.317 --> 00:01:26.219
or by joining the open source community.

28
00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.888
Thank you for taking this course and happy building.
